Drunkards, because they cannot focus their eyes,
often see a double image of what is in front of
them called in English "seeing double". The pun
here is between the shopkeeper seeing the PC
twice in successive visits to the shop, versus
the shopkeeper drinking liquor sold in the shop,
becoming drunk, and so seeing the PC twice at
the same time, once with each eye.

